e, city, state, or region to see mini-pantries in your area.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"http://mapping.littlefreepantry.org/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Find a Pantry</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","content":"<div style=\"color: #111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Additional Resources</h4>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row greyBoxes\">\n<div class=\"greyBoxes-box u-textCenter\">\n<h6 class=\"greyBoxes-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><i class=\"icon icon-magnifying-glass\"></i>For a Full List of Resources in Your Area, Dial 211</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">2-1-1 Is a 24/7 community assistance hotline designed to provide information and referral services to health, human, and social service organizations. Get help paying bills, finding food, and locating other resources in your area.</p>\n<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.211.org/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Learn More Here</a></p>\n<br><br><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row greyBoxes\">\n<div class=\"greyBoxes-box\">\n<h6 class=\"greyBoxes-title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><i class=\"icon icon-bread\"></i>Find a \"Mini-Pantry\" Near You</h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">There are dozens of food pantries in Northwest Arkansas. Simply type in your zip code, city, state, or region to see mini-pantries in your area.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"http://mapping.littlefreepantry.org/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Find a Pantry</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","description":"Text with HTML references.","draggable":true,"model":"6","position":1,"fullName":"content:wysiwyg_basic:2:82","htmlElement":"html","p